Module p "Probe: a way under the ground" {
  Description "Two dry rooms under a hill, half an hour apart by a gallery, and a field above.".
  Place hill "The hill" is region.
  Place works "The works" is site within hill at 0, 0.
  Place moor "The moor" is wilderness within hill at 1, 0.
  Place field "the field above" is room within moor at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place upper "the upper gallery" is room within works at 0, 0 underground.
  Place lower "the lower gallery" is room within works at 1, 0 underground.
  Company party "Your company" of 1 at upper.
  Passage gallery "the long gallery" is passage between upper and lower taking 30 minutes.
  Passage adit "the adit" is passage between lower and field taking 30 minutes.
  Observe upper_scene at upper when true "A dry gallery of cut stone.".
  Observe lower_scene at lower when true "Another, lower down.".
  Observe field_scene at field when true "Grass, and the sky.".
}
